{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A good friend is someone who\u2019ll give you the last piece of a cake. The best one will kick your butt to get it!&quot;</i>\u00a0<br>- <strong>Gore Gonzales, Khinkills.</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who could\u2019ve thought little Khinkills have so sweet tooth, it might make them a little but too murderous.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140770/extras/19f4d69c8ac6f1d882ccb5ccbc6c5094.apng?t=1765662544\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140770/extras/19f4d69c8ac6f1d882ccb5ccbc6c5094.poster.avif?t=1765662544\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick <strong>1 of 8 Khinkills frenemies</strong> and join the fight over the cake. <strong>Play alone</strong> to get the full cake for yourself or <strong>invite your friends</strong> and fight over that one last piece of cake. Or see what happens when the cake is suddenly gone\u2026<br><br>Laugh, taunt and send kisses - <strong>anything to distract</strong> your frenemies and make them angry. You see a candy? Grab it for the ultimate sugar rush!<br><br>Khinkills offers single player entertainment, PVP for local and online fights and a cooperative story mode.<br><br>- Up to 4 players.  <br>- 8 unique main characters inspired by khinkalli fillings<br>- ...and 8 more to rescue from the clutches of Khinkills' True Enemy!  <br><br>This is our first game, we hope you enjoy!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4140770?t=1765662544","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140770/c46672bd7401ddda659a32d120363f68e20e2f75/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765662544","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140770/4d57b2ee698d5564b1c2c983066a35296650551b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765662544","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140770/4d57b2ee698d5564b1c2c983066a35296650551b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765662544","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"blood, cartoon/characterised organs/bones"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A good friend is someone who\u2019ll give you the last piece of a cake. The best one will kick your butt to get it!&quot;</i>\u00a0<br>- <strong>Gore Gonzales, Khinkills.</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who could\u2019ve thought little Khinkills have so sweet tooth, it might make them a little but too murderous.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140770/extras/19f4d69c8ac6f1d882ccb5ccbc6c5094.apng?t=1765662544\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140770/extras/19f4d69c8ac6f1d882ccb5ccbc6c5094.poster.avif?t=1765662544\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick <strong>1 of 8 Khinkills frenemies</strong> and join the fight over the cake. <strong>Play alone</strong> to get the full cake for yourself or <strong>invite your friends</strong> and fight over that one last piece of cake. Or see what happens when the cake is suddenly gone\u2026<br><br>Laugh, taunt and send kisses - <strong>anything to distract</strong> your frenemies and make them angry. You see a candy? Grab it for the ultimate sugar rush!<br><br>Khinkills offers single player entertainment, PVP for local and online fights and a cooperative story mode.<br><br>- Up to 4 players.  <br>- 8 unique main characters inspired by khinkalli fillings<br>- ...and 8 more to rescue from the clutches of Khinkills' True Enemy!  <br><br>This is our first game, we hope you enjoy!</p>","developers":["Licho Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140770/0e4d3920b3e5f9b0a974a96dbe9f69690e09fbd7/header.jpg?t=1765662544","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 14 (Sonoma) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 15 (Sequoia) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M2 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4140770/1576286848/72eacec6da0c9d05c0a414acd146446dfefa809c/1765640741/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765641170","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4140770/1576286848/72eacec6da0c9d05c0a414a